  "title": "Coast Guard medevacs cruise ship passenger 80 miles east of Charleston",
  "description": "CHARLESTON, S.C. — The Coast Guard medevaced a man Saturday from a cruise ship 80 miles east of Charleston.\r\n\r\nMedevaced was Phillip Silverstein, 53.\r\n\r\nThe cruise ship Adventure of the Sea contacted Coast Guard Sector Charleston watchstanders stating a passenger was suffering from stomach pains and was in need of emergency care.\r\n \r\nAn MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew from Coast Guard Air Station Savannah launched and arrived at 7:30 p.m., hoisted the passenger and transported him to Medical University South Carolina for further care. ",
